{"channelId":"UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","row":["National Ataxia Foundation",7300,"The National Ataxia Foundation is dedicated to improving the lives of persons affected by ataxia through support, education, and research.\n\nNAF is a membership supported, nonprofit organization established in1957 to help persons with ataxia and their families. The Foundation's primary purpose is to support promising ataxia research and to provide vital programs and services for ataxia families.\n\nThis channel shares the faces of ataxia, provides information about ataxia, brings to light challenges those affected by ataxia face, and promotes opportunities to get involved in raising awareness and funds for ataxia. Thank you for watching.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:46.552Z","channelId":"UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5e1b55d5c198c7e4c1287643c84233e99ff92bb274412485e579c46d99659faa","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a4c18691852ba40483a6f05c18da032f5afc3936efae7869a22cf8d3b3837f30"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:46.552Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7300,"raw":"7.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRax0JQ0bjm90R2PSixQY0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:46.552Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v536A8RTS5w"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"